              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for to catch, then the Marathi for to cut."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: थांबणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "थांबणे — thāmbṇe — \"to stop, to wait\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "थांबणे (thāmbṇe) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from stambhate, \"supports, arrests\" (CDIAL 13683). CDIAL glosses the Marathi verb \"to stop\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
